were wounded. He said it was fewer than ten. No&nbsp;
one had wounds considered life threatening. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:14.160
four dead. The shooter dead. An additional up&nbsp;
to ten people wounded with non-life threatening&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:20.720
injuries. He told the Associated Press that the&nbsp;
medical complex was a, quote, catastrophic scene.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:26.800
The identities of the victims and the gunman&nbsp;
haven't been released as of this moment. By the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:33.200
time this story publishes, maybe some of that will&nbsp;
have been released. The motive wasn't immediately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:38.240
known. The shooting occurred a little before&nbsp;
five on the campus of Saint Francis Hospital.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:43.200
Officers were there within 3 minutes, made&nbsp;
contact with the gunman within another 5 minutes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:52.640
The police chief says, I was very happy with&nbsp;
what we know so far regarding the response of our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.640 --> 00:02:01.360
officers. Certainly an allusion to the response at&nbsp;
the Texas shooting, for sure. Officers encountered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:07.840
encountered the suspect on the second floor of the&nbsp;
hospital's Natalie building. The gunman is a black&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:15.680
male believed to be between 35 and 40. Armed with&nbsp;
a long gun and a handgun, both weapons appeared&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:20.720
