this is this is another one of these things where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:36.320
the details are catastrophic. The death toll is&nbsp;
tragic. It's just it's yet another shooting. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:43.360
as always, I find it important to remind you&nbsp;
